msgctxt "help:papyrus.queue,electronic_mail_urls_blacklist:"
msgid ""
"List of URL prefixes (one per line) that should not be downloaded. For "
"example, use http:// to NO download URLs starting with \"http://\""
msgstr "不应下载的 URL 前缀列表（每行一个）。例如，使用 http:// 可禁止下载以“http://”开头的 URL。"

msgctxt "help:papyrus.queue,electronic_mail_urls_default_policy:"
msgid ""
"The default policy to apply if URL does not match any of the whitlisted nor "
"blacklisted prefixes."
msgstr "URL 不匹配任何白名单或黑名单前缀时应用的默认策略。"

msgctxt "help:papyrus.queue,electronic_mail_urls_whitelist:"
msgid ""
"List of URL prefixes (one per line) that should be downloaded. For example, "
"use https:// to download all URLs starting with \"https://\"."
msgstr "应下载的 URL 前缀列表（每行一个）。例如，使用 https:// 可下载所有以“https://”开头的 URL。"

msgctxt "help:papyrus.queue,filename_blacklist:"
msgid ""
"List of filename-matching patterns (one per line). Filenames matching any of"
" the patterns will be discarded. Valid matching expressions include: *.pdf, "
"*.doc, invoice*.pdf"
msgstr "文件名匹配模式列表（每行一个）。匹配任一模式的文件将被丢弃。有效模式包括：*.pdf、*.doc、invoice*.pdf"

msgctxt "help:papyrus.queue,filename_whitelist:"
msgid ""
"List of filename-matching patterns (one per line). File names matching any "
"of the patterns will be created as documents as long as they do not match "
"any blacklist pattern. Valid matching expressions include: *.pdf, *.doc, "
"invoice*.pdf"
msgstr ""
"文件名匹配模式列表（每行一个）。匹配任一模式且不匹配任何黑名单模式的文件将被创建为文档。有效模式包括：*.pdf、*.doc、invoice*.pdf"

msgctxt "help:papyrus.queue,image_dpi:"
msgid ""
"DPI: This value indicates the number of pixels per inch that PDFs of "
"documents will generate when they come from multiple pages, if the system is"
" unable to get the value from the image on the page (usually in files in PDF"
" format). Instead, the system respects the number of pixels on the page when"
" they are capable of get them (typically JPEG files). Therefore, if the "
"system must use this parameter, the resulting PDF size may be affected. That"
" is why we recommend using JPEG files for pages."
msgstr ""
"DPI：当多页生成文档 PDF 且系统无法从页面图像获取分辨率（通常为 PDF 文件）时，此值指定每英寸的像素数。如果系统能获取页面像素数（通常为 "
"JPEG 文件），则采用原有值。因此，使用此参数可能影响生成的 PDF 尺寸。建议页面使用 JPEG 文件。"

